A '''Stoneworm''' is a [[Mob]] that can spawn when mining {{Item|Hard Stone}} inside the [[Crystal Hollows]]. 

== Spawning ==
A '''Stoneworm''' or {{MobSprite|Scatha}} has a {{Chance|0.167%|1|600}} chance of spawning when breaking {{Item|Hard Stone}} in a tunnel within the [[Crystal Hollows]]. There is a {{Green|30s}} cooldown every time a '''Stoneworm''' or {{MobSprite|Scatha}} spawns. A '''Stoneworm''' has an {{Chance|80%|4|5}} chance of being spawned, while a {{MobSprite|Scatha}} has a {{Chance|20%|1|5}} chance of being spawned instead.

Chance to spawn {{MobSprite|Stoneworm}}s can be increased with {{Reforge|Blazing}} reforge, [[Heart of the Mountain#Tunnel Vision|Tunnel Vision HotM]] perk and [[Marigold#Treasure of the Earth|Treasure of the Earth Gold Essence Shop]] perk. Chance to replace {{MobSprite|Stoneworm}}s with {{MobSprite|Scatha}}s can be increased with {{stat|tracking}}.

While spawning, '''Stoneworms''' and {{MobSprite|Scatha}}s make a unique squelching sound {{Green|3}} times, alerting players of their presence. Additionally, the following message appears in chat:
{{Dialogue|&7&oYou hear the sound of something approaching...}}

== Behavior ==
A '''Stoneworm''' slowly slithers through the tunnel it spawned in, turning back if it hits a block or gets too far away. It has {{Stat|health|5}}. They start off with a chain of 5 segments, which decrease by one each time they are hit until killed. Each hit deals {{HP|1}} of damage to the '''Stoneworm'''.

If no blocks are present under the '''Stoneworm''' when it moves, it will float through the air. It does not go up or down and stays at the Y level it spawned at.

