== Tips ==
* While {{Stat|Mining Spread}} does not directly prevent the player from spawning '''Stoneworms''' and {{MobSprite|Scatha}}s, it may reduce the chances depending on how the player mines.
** Generally, it is recommended to turn off all sources of {{Stat|Mining Spread}} while digging a tunnel forwards, and then mine the ceiling or wall of the tunnel backwards with {{Stat|Mining Spread}} enabled to maximize spawn chances.

== Trivia ==
* '''Stoneworms''' and {{MobSprite|Scatha}}s are affected by {{NPCSprite|Derpy;Mayor Derpy}}'s {{AN|DOUBLE MOBS HP!!!}} perk.

